Root cause:
The bug was caused by the incorrect handling of the variable `i` in the `FindLength` function, where it was declared outside of the loop, leading to potential logical errors in the loop conditions and increments. This could result in the loop not terminating as expected, causing an infinite loop or incorrect processing of the demuxing operation.

Code statements information:
